    "text": "valdostatoday.com\nwebsite\nValdosta\nValdosta residents invited to Townhall Community Preparedness Session\n4 hours ago\nVALDOSTA – Valdosta is inviting residents to prepare together at the Community Preparedness Information Session and Townhall. Valdosta City Councilman Nick Harden, Member-at-Large, is inviting residents to attend Preparing Together: Community Preparedness Information Session and Town Hall—an opportunity to learn, connect, and take proactive steps to safeguard the community before the next natural disaster.\n1",
